         announcement wrapped around the 3 existing degradation banner messages
         (execution_exact_alarm_degraded_message / execution_notification_permission_denied_message /
         execution_foreground_service_degraded_message). Applied via Modifier.semantics{
         contentDescription = ... } so the banners' visible Text (and existing assertTextEquals
         checks in ExecutionScreenTest) is unchanged; only the accessibility-tree announcement
         gains the "Warning:" prefix. %1$s is the existing message. -->
    <string name="accessibility_warning_announcement">Warning: %1$s</string>

